					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760350101,
					"content": "(Is Columbina... not in?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350102,
					"content": "Looking for me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350103,
					"content": "Waaah!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350104,
						760350105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350104,
					"content": "You scared me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350106,
					"content": "After sensing your arrival, I wanted to see how close I could get to you from behind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350107,
					"content": "Because you have nothing better to do, or...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350108,
					"content": "Hm... Is that how it seems? No different than when I was with the Fatui, then... There was never much for me to do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350109,
					"content": "The Tsaritsa only sought the power of the Moon Goddesses. I was never dispatched to seize a Gnosis or anything like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350110,
					"content": "So what would you do to pass the time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350111,
					"content": "Take walks, watch the moon, sometimes sing... But, I came to do that last one less and less after Sandrone forbade it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350112,
					"content": "Hmm? She didn't like your singing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350113,
					"content": "No. She praised it, actually. But, I had only recently joined the Fatui then, and she said my singing set the others on edge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350114,
					"content": "Because, for those not in the know, it seemed like I was about to use... some sort of power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350115,
					"content": "Oh, huh... Paimon can sort of understand that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350116,
					"content": "Oh, and there was another reason. She said she did most of her research at night, so if I sang during the day, it would disturb her attempts to catch up on sleep.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350117,
					"content": "(This was the main reason, I'll bet!)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350118,
					"content": "So, I used to just sing outside her door at night instead. But, still. She always chased me away...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350119,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350120,
					"content": "Did you get along with the others?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350121,
					"content": "\"Get along\"? Hmm... When we first met, Arlecchino did seem eager to \"get along\" with me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350122,
					"content": "She often showed up behind me without making a sound, like I did to you earlier. She said it was an attempt to \"test\" me, I believe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350123,
					"content": "I, too, attempted to join in on the game, but she always managed to spot me before I even got close.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350124,
					"content": "Eventually, I resorted to using kuuvahki and managed to give her quite a scare from behind. But, she never played that game with me again after that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350125,
					"content": "(Yeah, Paimon doubts that was a \"game\" to the Knave at all...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350126,
					"content": "What else... Oh, The Doctor often asked me to assist in his Light Realm-related research.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350127,
					"content": "I obliged him a few times, but it was so dull. \"Use kuuvahki to strike this,\" \"use kuuvahki to control that\"... I stopped going after a while.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350128,
						760350129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350128,
					"content": "Looks like you're in a good mood today...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350130,
					"content": "Yes. Even though I've \"run away from home,\" I do have some fond memories of it all the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350131,
					"content": "Arlecchino and Sandrone treated me quite well, along with...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350132,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350133,
					"content": "(That expression... I wonder who she's thinking about...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350134,
					"content": "Give me your hand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350135,
						760350136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350135,
					"content": "...Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350137
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350137,
					"content": "Rosalyne taught me... It's important to always express gratitude to others.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350138,
					"content": "So, thank you for listening to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350139,
					"content": "Don't mention it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350140,
					"content": "(Is this... the Moon Goddess's Favor?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350141
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350141,
					"content": "I believe that's enough for today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350142,
					"content": "Whoa, that was sudden!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350143,
						760350144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350143,
					"content": "Shh... Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350145,
					"content": "Yeah, guess you're right. Well, let's not bother her, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760350144,
					"content": "She's remembering certain things from her past, I think...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350136,
					"content": "...Why?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350137
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350129,
					"content": "You spoke quite a bit about your past...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760350105,
					"content": "You really had to pop up from behind like that...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760350106
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}